// ("rfmechanics:block-spitpackedsand-peridotite") showed up in a live barrel-recipe test.
// First pass used one "block-{code}-*" wildcard entry per family (vanilla's own
// block-bonysoil-*/block-forestfloor-* convention); replaced here with a full per-variant
// entry for the 5 rock/fertility/moisture-varying families so the rock/fertility/moisture
// is visible in the name (e.g. "Granite spit-packed sand", not just "Spit-packed Sand"),
